    "description": {
      "content": "The Lumen Internet On-Demand API enables programmatic provisioning and management of internet bandwidth services. It provides access to Lumen's global fiber network, allowing customers to dynamically adjust bandwidth, manage connections, and automate network provisioning through a secure REST API using OAuth 2.0 client credentials authentication.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Lumen Developer Center",
